{
 "batchId": "b-0700",
 "sourceSetHash": "176063301134397b847ded608555d81e009a988104076f14e91b5d75e644a104",
 "locale": "nl",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_0842f912e1e160251ead",
   "sourceHash": "0842f912e1e160251eade4a02a328efe8d038637df48855248bbdce9d6f2328e",
   "text": "Exclusief voor de Air India Maharaja Club",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a3e6bcce8fd29d94da4",
   "sourceHash": "2a3e6bcce8fd29d94da4b4215e54a3c2e37a5fe966ae46d3b50376d3fa19c212",
   "text": "Een ayurvedische retreat in Kerala — exclusief voor leden van de Air India Maharaja Club",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ee0fe193fbfada1ad04f",
   "sourceHash": "ee0fe193fbfada1ad04f6070c9860b320835c585c966755bcd50a3dbfce8cf17",
   "text": "Gepersonaliseerde ayurvedische programma's, traditionele therapieën en een rustig verblijf midden in de natuur in Palakkad, Kerala.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_88551fb7840d81fea3c0",
   "sourceHash": "88551fb7840d81fea3c08ef31e9e47ef5375491d7d6bf278bbc6fb3fafb63f26",
   "text": "De [[TAG_1]] in de bron tussen leadStrong en leadRest wordt weergegeven als regeleinde; de woordgrens blijft behouden (nooit aaneengeschreven).",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8b4aac2acdd7f94c01cc",
   "sourceHash": "8b4aac2acdd7f94c01cce6f302ed54083689db94db268e91b864ed9a6993e7ba",
   "text": "( Verdien 15 Maharaja Points per ₹ 100 besteed )",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1882797d2bc7d14892f6",
   "sourceHash": "1882797d2bc7d14892f64320240260523beb39f8bfce2052ba6775795bf58dbb",
   "text": "U vindt dit in uw Air India-app of op uw lidmaatschapskaart",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_52c4409fad13bc24dc8a",
   "sourceHash": "52c4409fad13bc24dc8abf4cc3cdeb443d6ddbea0cb686bfe3949688363f0953",
   "text": "Het erfgoed van Kairali",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_46f500f127950f7dd13a",
   "sourceHash": "46f500f127950f7dd13aea13785c3566ce411ab1ae8c68a38fae65678ebc0d32",
   "text": "Authentieke ayurveda, transformerende resultaten.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3d7b330895502647aa3f",
   "sourceHash": "3d7b330895502647aa3f29bcdd82b7b68b2fea9c98fc2b78f5b6cdcfb8908e2c",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village is geworteld in de levende ayurvedische traditie van Kerala, waarin dagelijkse routines, therapieën en voeding samenwerken als één systeem. Elk verblijf begint met een consult bij een arts, gevolgd door een persoonlijk plan dat is afgestemd op uw lichaamstype en doelen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3f07bd6eb3de54dde139",
   "sourceHash": "3f07bd6eb3de54dde139c333a678631f7609505d346c465fba1f20fbc9db6043",
   "text": "Vertrouwd door bezoekers die bewust met hun welzijn bezig zijn en gestructureerde, door artsen geleide ayurveda zoeken.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9cce8704fbef2e8c587e",
   "sourceHash": "9cce8704fbef2e8c587e47a091f1cec907cf6ece05cbdd3f3a545620875bf163",
   "text": "De bronalinea bevat drie [[TAG_1]]-grenzen (na de openende strong, en een dubbel regeleinde vóór de afsluitende strong); ze worden als aparte regels weergegeven met behoud van spaties.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1432897a6136de54f3a8",
   "sourceHash": "1432897a6136de54f3a8bfcc9f9fa87ead45c109731e5769a6e94887d555ce5b",
   "text": "Erfgoed",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bda7e8e0efc6c3991184",
   "sourceHash": "bda7e8e0efc6c3991184b7eecac516b99a1c7dd8774d68454f14a365cef1389e",
   "text": "Waarom Kairali voor holistisch welzijn",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a076f37608954bb87035",
   "sourceHash": "a076f37608954bb87035a17308aaaa20f52484db4edc732ba9a022cd7622c897",
   "text": "Bij Kairali is ayurveda geen losse behandeling. Het is een dagelijks ritme.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5389c36debd4365feafb",
   "sourceHash": "5389c36debd4365feafb2b92546a6e31a62437e98bc3f73da72681641a0efc26",
   "text": "Consult bij de arts",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_49c85c065b38682ea026",
   "sourceHash": "49c85c065b38682ea026cda08d31ad6e9fc96b77dca1cdc3cabe1333cc11fe7f",
   "text": "Een individuele beoordeling stuurt uw volledige welzijnsprogramma, met nauwkeurige zorg afgestemd op uw constitutie en gezondheidsdoelen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_673d5ed8f3b13815adcd",
   "sourceHash": "673d5ed8f3b13815adcdc8c3456a743eeb5400e878801a356d50f8132884c6fb",
   "text": "Ayurvedische therapieën",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_093a7e59b328bb82daa8",
   "sourceHash": "093a7e59b328bb82daa8e5484f26431f3945fccfd99dc9e5fa00200c68244c11",
   "text": "Traditionele behandelingen door ervaren therapeuten, zoals aanbevolen door onze artsen, voor een zo groot mogelijk therapeutisch effect.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf35c02797141eb4b6e8",
   "sourceHash": "cf35c02797141eb4b6e834df76bc967a6616e025f09f2f659904734fa411e6f1",
   "text": "Ayurvedische maaltijden",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0a9cec56dc14888895a3",
   "sourceHash": "0a9cec56dc14888895a3dc7b09129e41fcdf230ff685234859fa6530312421a8",
   "text": "Voedzame, verse gerechten, speciaal bereid als aanvulling op uw therapieën en ter ondersteuning van uw welzijnsdoelen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8128fed1ad95b6ecc9f9",
   "sourceHash": "8128fed1ad95b6ecc9f9d57a1e70408a30c71f81c219efc069f9cd667652423a",
   "text": "Dagelijkse oefeningen die uw programma versterken en lichaam en geest in harmonie brengen met eeuwenoude welzijnstechnieken.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f206badb753ce24edcc",
   "sourceHash": "6f206badb753ce24edcc6ac8a6d7a547d6cfc6838da03f8eac3335a4af9f7658",
   "text": "Intensieve therapeutische ervaringen, afgestemd op uw welzijnsdoelen en lichaamsconstitutie.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_650b4cfcd276517eac17",
   "sourceHash": "650b4cfcd276517eac17473c371407239316d0328b9db1e8a010edc4aae462ff",
   "text": "Twee therapeuten masseren de rug van een patiënt",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a658d2e37a1ad81af5a5",
   "sourceHash": "a658d2e37a1ad81af5a58f43afa95736f5d87c5d3dbef2555228c92fc3987f04",
   "text": "Abhyanga-massagetherapie",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dc810b1a5ff164eee790",
   "sourceHash": "dc810b1a5ff164eee79007925d65d55e9ce6b656332444970f8564fc250693ad",
   "text": "Voor diepgaande detoxificatie, herstel van de spijsvertering, afvoer van gifstoffen en balans in het hele lichaam.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
